<item>
            <title>[MAHOUT-714] CollocDriver not runnable with ToolRunner due to private Constructor</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/MAHOUT-714</link>
                <project id="12310751" key="MAHOUT">Mahout</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;I noticed that CollocDriver has a private Constructor, which means that I can&apos;t run it via ToolRunner&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Configuration configuration = ...&lt;br/&gt;
String[] collocArgs =  ...&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;ToolRunner.run(configuration, new CollocDriver(), args);&lt;/p&gt;</description>
